            {
              "role": "system",
              "content": "You are a logistics operations analyst AI. You evaluate delayed shipments and decide whether to automatically reroute them or escalate to a human, balancing delivery speed, cost, and customer priority. Return ONLY valid JSON, no markdown formatting, no explanation text."
            },
            {
              "content": "=Shipment Details:\n{{ JSON.stringify($('Split Delayed Shipments').item.json) }}\n\nAlternate Routes Found:\n{{ JSON.stringify($json) }}\n\nBusiness rules: Auto-reroute is allowed only if the estimated cost increase is under 10% AND the shipment's Priority is not \"Critical\". Otherwise, it must be escalated for human approval.\n\nRespond with ONLY a JSON object in exactly this shape:\n{\n  \"recommended_action\": \"auto_reroute\" or \"escalate\" or \"monitor\",\n  \"new_carrier\": string,\n  \"new_route\": string,\n  \"estimated_new_eta\": \"YYYY-MM-DD\",\n  \"cost_impact_percent\": number,\n  \"reasoning\": string,\n  \"requires_approval\": boolean\n}"
            }
